. Look at them up close and watch them react as you prepare a line-clearing move. Choose Classic, Endless or Daily Challenge. In Endless mode, the environment gradually changes as your score climbs, with flowing lights and new colors. Animated backgrounds can be switched off in Settings. Play in an immersive VR environment or bring the puzzle into your room with mixed reality. Move around the board and discover a familiar puzzle from a new angle. Single-player. Two tracked controllers. English and Turkish language support.", "display_long_description_unprocessed": "A puzzle you can reach out and pick up. FaceZap: 3D World brings colorful block puzzles into your space. Use two controllers to grab and turn jelly-like pieces. Place them carefully on the board, or line up a gentle throw. Complete rows and columns, collect ZAP energy and clear space with a well-timed blast. Meet expressive little faces inside glossy, liquid-filled blocks. Look at them up close and watch them react as you prepare a line-clearing move. Choose Classic, Endless or Daily Challenge. In Endless mode, the environment gradually changes as your score climbs, with flowing lights and new colors. Animated backgrounds can be switched off in Settings. Play in an immersive VR environment or bring the puzzle into your room with mixed reality. Move around the board and discover a familiar puzzle from a new angle. Single-player. Two tracked controllers. English and Turkish language support.", "genre_names": ["Arcade", "Puzzle", "Action"], "has_in_app_ads": false, "id": "1374490409088031", "is_approved": false, "is_concept": false, "is_enterprise_enabled": false, "organization": {"id": "", "is_authorized_for_quest": false, "application_groupings": {"count": 0, "nodes": [], "__typename": "", "typename_enum": 0}}, "platform": "", "publisher_name": "Wizard Medya - AEY", "required_space_adjusted": 29463036, "requiredSpaceAdjustedFormatted": "28.1 MB", "total_installed_space": 15030297, "totalInstalledSpaceForma